@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SenaPay | Acceso Denegado</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@500;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root { --c: #39A900; --cr: rgba(57,169,0,.07); }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #f0f4f0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
            max-width: 440px;
            width: 90%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
        }

        .icon-wrap {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(220, 38, 38, .1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
        }

        .icon-wrap i {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #dc2626;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin-bottom: .5rem;
        }

        p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: .95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--c);
            color: #fff;
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            padding: .75rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity .2s;
        }

        .btn:hover { opacity: .85; }

        .logo {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <span class="logo">Sena<span style="color:#1a1a1a">Pay</span></span>
        <div class="icon-wrap">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i>
        </div>
        <h1>Acceso denegado</h1>
        <p>No tienes permiso para acceder a esta sección.<br>Por favor regresa a tu portal o inicia sesión con la cuenta correcta.</p>
        <a href="/Account/Account/Login" class="btn">
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i> Volver al inicio
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
